1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Open Realtime and wait for the camera list to load.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Under Camera input, choose your integrated webcam.
Click Start.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Once the live video appears, click Send output to OBS,
then Copy OBS URL.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:32,000
In OBS, click + under Sources and choose Browser.
Name the source RealFaceAI and click OK.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Paste the copied link into URL.
Set Width to 1920 and Height to 1080, then click OK.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Your OBS scene is ready when the video appears in the preview.

7
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:55,000
To use the video in another app, click
Start Virtual Camera under Controls in OBS.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:01,000
In the other app, select OBS Virtual Camera
in camera settings and check the preview.

9
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:07,000
No video in OBS? Check that Realtime is live
and sending output to OBS.

10
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:14,000
No video in the other app? Check that the virtual camera
is running in OBS and selected in the app.
